58
00:03:21,740 --> 00:03:24,480
Now look at Alex's monthly cash budget.

59
00:03:24,480 --> 00:03:27,700
About $535 for the loan.

60
00:03:28,320 --> 00:03:29,560
$200 for insurance.

61
00:03:30,480 --> 00:03:31,800
$140 for fuel.

62
00:03:32,520 --> 00:03:33,500
$100 for maintenance.

63
00:03:34,300 --> 00:03:36,860
Plus roughly $21 for annual registration.

64
00:03:38,180 --> 00:03:42,920
That's about $995 a month before the
